      "id": "claim_4e1ccac67d1648958b7b6f30fb3e1bb3",
      "statement": "Gluetun is the only service with its own network namespace and the only one holding NET_ADMIN and /dev/net/tun; it disables IPv6 via sysctls and publishes the qBittorrent, Prowlarr and loopback-only VPN status ports.",
